file: macros/src/implement.rs
breaks: Every forwarded method carries `#[inline]` or the trait method's own `#[inline(..)]`, as `docs/what-is-generated.md` says.
expect: survives
reason: The shape check reads the bodies of the forwarded methods and no attribute, and no check reads the impl's attributes.

find:
        .unwrap_or_else(|| quote_spanned! { site => #[inline] });
replace:
        .unwrap_or_default();
